{
  "_guide": {
    "standing": "literally chop from sword falling, also inflicts armor down",
    "falling": "wider heavy chop that disables shields, if the target is exhausted or enfeebled, bind their main hand",
    "aerial": "longer range hook that pulls the target to you, idk axe isn't really an aerial weapon",
    "sprinting": "dispersing spin attack with low damage but high knockback",
    "guard counter": "handle jab that deals good posture damage and silences/nauseates, at max spirit follow with a wide vertical breaching swing",
    "throw": "immediately embeds in first target and auto-recalls after a while. At max spirit, explodes and inflicts frost in an area, because kratos.",
    "pickup": "spin it in your hand, resetting attack cooldown",
    "draw": "forward shoulder tackle that drags a single mob."
  },
